  "title": "Comment \"Council\" and I'll send you the prompt 👇 Claude agrees with you 49% more than a human would",
  "description": "Comment \"Council\" and I'll send you the prompt 👇 Claude agrees with you 49% more than a human would. Here's one prompt that forces it to stop being a yes man. It's called the LLM Council. Just type \"Ask the Council\" and Claude spins up 5 AI agent advisors that attack your question from completely different angles: • Contrarian — finds the flaw in anything you said • First Principles Thinker — ignores your question and figures out what you're actually trying to solve • Expansionist — finds the upside you're missing • Outsider — given no context so it catches the obvious stuff • Executor — only cares about what you should do next Claude then runs all their answers through 5 peer review agents and a Chairman synthesizes everything into one final verdict. No more yes man. Just the truth. #claude #ai #claudeprompts #aitools #productivity",
